Z||000007||Fie Ro||09-10-2001||08:56 AM||||You DID reach me Rob, so here I am ;-)<BR>I wouldn't advise to fight a healthy tree but although my fiero was wrecked from front to engine (which is now in somebody's fiero!) I was amazed how my body managed to avoid most of the debris. I think the midconsole/tunnel saved my legs and of course the fact that the engine is in the back. <BR>The fact that the car had such a damage and I came out alive convinced me that a fiero IS SAFE!<P>That's why I bought one again several months later. After 5 minutes of slow driving there was no fear or traumatic reaction so I was back on the road ;-) But a little more cautious this time ;-)<P>see y'all around,<BR>Roderick<P>------------------<BR>-The Beauty & The Beast-<BR>1987 Pontiac Fiero GT & <BR>1977 Dodge W20||||reg||12
